  "description": "ModernTrackBar.WinForms is an ultra-smooth, anti-aliased TrackBar and Slider control for C# Windows Forms applications. Features include dynamic linear gradient tracks, live floating value displays, responsive hover/focus interactions, built-in themes (NeonBlue, EmeraldGreen, DarkMode, LightMode, PodargusSpecial), and seamless Visual Studio Designer toolbox integration. Multi-targeted for .NET Framework 4.7.2, 4.8, .NET 6 Windows, and .NET 8 Windows.",
